# The frontend image (frontend/Dockerfile) builds from the REPO ROOT so it can
# reach repo-root docs/help (help-centre articles + screenshots, #2786). Without
# a whitelist that would stream the whole monorepo — desktop/ (11G), deploy/dist
# (441M), android/, node_modules — to the daemon. So: ignore everything, then
# re-include only what that build needs. Keep top-level negations only (BuildKit
# won't re-include a path whose parent dir is still excluded).
*

!frontend
!docs

# frontend/ carries build junk we never want in the context.
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.yarn
**/*.log
